DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppppmmttoorrggbb33  reads  a  PPM  image as input and writes three PGM images as
       output, one each for red, green, and blue.

       ppppmmttoorrggbb33 constructs the output filenames by taking the input filename,
       stripping off any extension, and appending ..rreedd, ..ggrrnn, ..bblluu.  For exam‐
       ple, separating lleennnnaa..ppppmm would result  in  lleennnnaa..rreedd,  lleennnnaa..ggrrnn,  and
       lleennnnaa..bblluu.   If  the  input comes from stdin, the names are nnoonnaammee..rreedd,
       nnoonnaammee..ggrrnn, and nnoonnaammee..bblluu.


